2026-11-13T10:21:49.4789930Z 
2026-11-13T10:21:49.4790330Z     def replace_output_of_nodes(self, old_output_name, new_output_name, node_names_set):
2026-11-13T10:21:49.4791073Z         for node in self.model.graph.node:
